{"ref":"BDB, רָמָה","hw":"רָמָה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָמָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. height, high-place</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> as term. techn. (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בָּמָה\" href=\"/BDB,_בָּמָה\", dir=\"rtl\">בָּמָה</a>), = <em>shrine</em> (for illicit worship): <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.25\">Ez 16:25</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּב</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:39\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.39\">39</a>; so perhaps <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.6\">1 S 22:6</a>, but read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּמָה</span>, 𝔊 Βαμα (A Ραμμα), HPS.","next":"BDB, רָמָה²","prev":"BDB, רָם"}